WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.900
Will you marry me?

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.910
How am I supposed to answer when you ask so suddenly?

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.540
Irie-kun still hasn't come home.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:34.100
I wonder if he's holding hands with her right now.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.860
Are they kissing or something?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.980
My head is in a total mess.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:01.850
I'm back.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.200
You're late!

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.610
What's with that incredible look?

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.650
I heard from the director.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.130
What do you think you're doing by attending that marriage interview?

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:14.440
You didn't even talk to us.
Just what are you thinking?

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:16.590
Irie-kun!

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.690
Even Papa is furious.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:20.580
He said he doesn't remember ever requesting such a thing.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.520
It's not for Dad's sake.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.960
Don't lie!

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.500
You intend to sacrifice yourself
for the company!

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.560
You're mistaken.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.230
Then, why?

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:31.520
I like her.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.840
What?

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.000
It's a legitimate reason, right?

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.200
Onii-chan!

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.680
Welcome back. You're quite late.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:52.340
I didn't think you'd come home tonight either.

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.270
You two were getting along really well after all.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.700
That's not...

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:04.300
That's right. Kin-chan is funny, kind...

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:07.060
...and he doesn't say mean things like a certain someone.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:08.890
That's good then.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.810
Irie-kun, you idiot.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.220
He proposed?!

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:54.990
Kin-chan did that?

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.130
Well done.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.220
So, how did you answer?

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:01.740
I haven't given an answer.
I do like Kin-chan, but...

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.140
...that's just as a good friend.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:07.050
I don't know how to respond to his sudden marriage proposal.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.110
I guess so.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:15.490
But frankly, I think Kin-chan is a much better match for you than Irie.

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:18.870
Well, Irie does have a girlfriend too.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:23.050
In regards to this, you should think about Kin-chan seriously.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.580
Kin-chan has always had feelings for you.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:33.100
Since you have a one-sided relationship with Irie, you should know how he feels.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:40.830
Satomi certainly might be right.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.780
Watch where you're going.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.300
I'm sorry.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.310
It's hopeless.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.310
My head is so dazed that it's not functioning at all.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.630
Here.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.490
Thank you very much.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.880
Christine-san?

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.770
Just Chris will do.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.670
Why are you here?

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.270
I got Naoki to bring me here.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.220
Irie-kun?

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.880
Sheesh. What are you doing?

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:21.780
We're going for lunch. Would you like to join us?

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.180
Eh? But...

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.150
Let's do so. What do you say, Naoki?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:26.140
Sure.

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:35.700
Hey Kin-chan! Why are you
daydreaming like that?

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.140
You've been acting strange all morning.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.270
I'm sorry.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.240
Kotoko?

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.170
Kinnosuke!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:48.500
Here you go, a large serving of rice.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.410
Eat up.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.060
What's going on?

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.750
She's here to take a look at a Japanese university.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.500
Then, why are you with her?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.330
It just kinda happened by chance.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:05.100
Kinnosuke, I ordered mackerel miso.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.200
Thanks for waiting.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.440
Chris, you're okay with Japanese cuisine?

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:11.790
Yes, I love Japanese cuisine.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:15.170
Kin-chan, can you give her a fork and a knife?

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:19.400
Don't be silly. Mackerel miso won't taste good if it isn't eaten with chopsticks.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.160
Will the taste change if I use a fork instead of chopsticks?

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:28.590
That's right. Every dish has an optimum method of eating it.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.280
Great!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:34.730
It's really important to have pride in your own work, right?

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:37.870
I'll use chopsticks then.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:40.880
Kotoko.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:45.130
Umm, about yesterday...

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:48.650
Chris sure is a nice girl, isn't she?

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:54.360
Anyway, have some mackerel miso too. It's really good.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.830
That's right. I guess I'll have mackerel miso too then.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.610
All right, I'll prepare you the largest one yet!

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.880
Yay!

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.330
Wait a bit.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.670
A little bit of rice is okay.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.030
Roger that.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.680
Huh? He invited you to his house?

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:16.670
After this?

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.840
Yeah. I want to introduce her to Mom as well.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.750
Will it be okay?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:22.660
What is?

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:25.580
What if she finds out that we're living together?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.700
You'll be coming home with us too, right?

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:32.710
Kotoko, you're loadfreeing
at Naoki's house, right?

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:34.030
It's freeloading.

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:38.390
Oh, that's right. Japanese is so hard.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.680
Load... freeloading!

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.820
This is my younger brother, Yuuki.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:47.870
Nice to meet you, I'm Chris.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.240
Hello.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:56.100
Aww, you're so cute, Yuuki-kun. Getting all nervous because Chris is so beautiful.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:56.960
Where's Mom?

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:00.350
Upstairs. I think she'll be down soon.

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:01.170
Sheesh.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.480
Irie's mother is a really fun person.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.430
I'm sure you'll get along great.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.010
Mom, what have you been doing?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.030
Welcome. I'm Naoki's mother.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:26.860
Oba-sama!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.150
This is Christine Robbins.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.540
Nice to meet you.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.410
Nice to meet you.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.270
Oh, a cake?

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:39.500
Well, you didn't have to be so thoughtful.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.880
But unfortunately Naoki dislikes sweets.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:48.460
He doesn't mind Japanese confectionery. But he can't handle cakes at all.

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:51.070
Umm...

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:51.720
Well...
Umm...

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:56.460
I guess it can't be helped since you two don't know each other that well.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:02.930
You got it wrong. I bought that for you.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:07.160
I brought some Japanese confectionery.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:10.150
I heard that Naoki-san really likes these.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.660
Sorry for the trouble.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:31.690
This sweet looks really good.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.050
Chris, shall we eat?

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.800
Thanks for the food.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.540
Oh dear me.

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:47.570
As expected from a noble.
You're very ladylike.

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:51.070
You could say that she's throwing away her youth though.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:57.970
But, Chris is actually very active, despite how she appears.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.820
She mentioned earlier that she loves sports as well.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:04.070
Yes, horseback riding and golf.
I've also started tennis recently.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:07.410
Really? Irie-kun and I are in the tennis club.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.550
Irie-kun is really good!

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:14.190
You sure can do anything, Naoki.
I'm so envious.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.430
I'll teach you next time.

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:21.310
But, I'm really terrible.
You'd probably get sick of me.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.560
Yeah, he'd surely get sick of you.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:26.180
Oba-sama!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.630
Naoki is really mean.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:33.640
He would scorn anyone who couldn't understand his teachings the first time around.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:36.340
Anyway, this cold child...

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:39.260
He would throw away a love letter from a girl in front of her eyes.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.460
He would throw presents away in front of her.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:45.100
Even if she gathered the courage to confess, he would just turn her down in front of everyone.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:50.330
He's a cold-hearted person who doesn't have an ounce of sympathy.

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.470
What was that about just now?

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:04.340
What are you saying?
I'm just telling her the truth.

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:06.730
Your plan to get between us
is plainly obvious.

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.340
Please stop behaving so selfishly.

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.880
Huh? What do you mean by selfish?

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:16.390
You're trying to force us together because you like Kotoko.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:23.070
I just thought that you and Kotoko-chan make a good couple!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:25.720
And I'm telling you that's selfishness!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:28.750
Don't interfere with other people's relationships!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.840
I don't want to be hampered by you.

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:33.300
Hampered?

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.720
Look at yourself! You know Kotoko-chan's feelings, yet...

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:39.780
...you bring another girl here. There's a limit to how inconsiderate one can be!

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:43.350
Oba-sama, don't worry; I'm all right with it.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.830
But!

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:47.300
Kotoko says so herself.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.770
Please don't try to interfere any more.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:53.930
Fine then! Do as you please.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.140
Oba-sama!

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:11.710
Kin-chan?

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:16.150
It's me. Can you please come to Shige tomorrow?

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:20.820
I've improved that dish you tried before. I was wondering if you could sample it for me.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.820
I'll call you again later.

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:24.760
Tomorrow...

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.430
Onii-chan...

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.870
Are you really going to marry her?

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:56.750
You must be happy. You said that you wanted a beautiful sister, right?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.830
But, you really like...

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.180
I'll get Chris to help you with your English next time.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:11.510
Hey Dad, would you be happy if I married Kin-chan?

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:14.100
Huh? What's this all about?

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.040
It's just a "what if".

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:22.620
He's a very carefree person, but he shows promise when it comes to culinary skills.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:28.190
If he becomes part of the family, then I guess I'll be happy since I'll have a successor.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.030
I see.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:32.020
However, your feelings are most important.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:37.790
But, there's nothing I can do if our feelings aren't mutual.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:42.680
Kotoko, we really should leave this house.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.390
You know it yourself, right?

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:50.710
It's unnatural for us to stay here any longer.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.990
Everything is out of order.

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.280
Dad.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:56.630
You must be having it hard too, right?

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:00.650
It'll be better for you to leave here in order to forget Naoki-kun.

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.800
You're right...

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:12.100
This time, I really should give up, right?

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.990
It's important for a girl to know when to give up.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:21.430
Besides, this is a good chance for you to make Naoki realize what a great girl you were.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.700
Right, Kotoko?

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.630
Hello, Kin-chan?

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.380
It's me.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:31.820
About tomorrow...

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:34.740
Yeah, I can go.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.330
Got it. I'll see you at the shop at 5 o'clock then.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.340
I'll be looking forward to it. Bye.

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.050
It's fine this way.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.190
Naoki said something like that?

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.670
What should we do?

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:56.690
There's nothing we can do
if that's what he wants, right?

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:59.870
And you opposed when he wanted to become a doctor!

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:06.170
I thought that Onii-chan actually loved Kotoko-chan.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.130
But...

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.300
He does.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.820
Yuuki?

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.230
He does love Kotoko.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:17.100
What do you mean? What basis do you have for saying that?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.540
Yuuki, tell Mama if you know anything.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.940
Wait, Yuuki!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.000
The one who Onii-chan likes...

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.090
It's Kotoko.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.840
She sure is a carefree person.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.590
I got an idea!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:47.170
I'm sure she'll get scared if I dangled this in front of her eyes.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:51.860
Onii-chan!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:11.870
The one who Onii-chan likes is Kotoko.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.380
Looks like it's gonna rain.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.180
So, shall we call it a day then?

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:22.870
Don't be a slacker! The tennis club doesn't stop because of a little rain!

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.570
Where were you looking at?!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.600
I'm sorry.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:32.880
Not at all, Matsumoto. It's my fault for standing here.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:36.640
Matsumoto? What's wrong, Matsumoto?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.840
No, it's nothing.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:41.870
No, you've been acting strangely lately.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.150
You can talk to me if you have any problems.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:45.020
Irie-kun?

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.410
Oh, Irie!

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:48.890
It's been a while.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.030
Why are you here today?

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.640
Nah, I just came to take a look.

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:55.260
Besides, shouldn't you be doing
your job hunting?

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:57.790
Don't say that!

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.660
It's been a while, Irie-kun.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:04.560
Are things going well with you and the girl from the marriage interview?

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.290
Kind of.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.210
I don't like that girl.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.810
It's rather boring to have a girl without any flaws to pick at.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:15.770
I'd rather have Aihara-san clinging onto you.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:19.980
That way, I could say that I'm the better woman.

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:21.990
Ah, it's Irie!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.700
Hey, is it true that you're getting married?

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.740
Kotoko was seriously depressed.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.570
Jinko!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.620
Aihara-san isn't with you two?

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.480
Kotoko has gone back already.

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:35.480
She said that she had an appointment with Kin-chan.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:38.180
Ah, the guy from the cafeteria.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.700
She sure has lowered her standards.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.920
But, Kin-chan was pretty bold.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.610
He proposed to her out of the blue.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:50.880
She even ditched practice to meet him.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.310
She might actually be interested in getting married.

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:56.190
Will his five years of love finally blossom?

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:59.780
And Irie, Kotoko tried her best
to love you as well...

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.660
It's raining.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.510
I should have brought an umbrella.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.610
It's okay. I'll walk you home later.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.440
Here, try it.

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:23.260
Wow, looks great!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.750
Thanks for the meal.

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:27.460
How is it?

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.460
It's good! It's even better than before!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.240
All right!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.240
Don't be modest and eat up!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:57.110
I'm so full. It was great!

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.960
Should I cut some fruits for you?

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:02.690
You sure have a good sense
when it comes to food.

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:04.780
My father was praising you too.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:06.890
I still have a long way to go to catch up to your father.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.210
I'm sure you'll catch up real soon.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.960
Thank you.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.520
It's best to hear it directly from you.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.330
Hey, Kotoko...

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.340
Will you give me a reply?

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:28.550
Well, can I have more time...

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.770
...to think about it?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.240
Is it Irie?

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:41.500
What's so good about that cold-hearted bastard?

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:43.750
It's not like...

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:52.590
Kotoko!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.800
You're the only person in my eyes!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.240
Kin-chan?

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:00.400
Wait...

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.640
I'll make you forget about that bastard!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.770
I'll make you forget!

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:08.740
No, don't! Kin-chan!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.730
No! Irie-kun!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.240
I see...

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:26.220
So, it really is Irie...

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.660
Forgive me.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.800
God damn it!

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:47.870
I'm such a horrible person.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:55.100
I led Kin-chan on...

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.860
But, what came out of me then was "Irie-kun".

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.380
I worried over it, and then decided to give up, and yet...

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:07.930
I guess Irie-kun is the only one for me.

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:12.600
In that case, I'd stay single
for the rest of my life.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:17.070
And when my time finally comes, I'd be secretly carrying a picture of Irie-kun.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.090
Irie-kun?

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:11.990
What's the meaning of this?!

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.080
Onii-chan? Kotoko-chan?

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.870
See, it's all right just like I said.

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.860
Yuuki, just what do you know?

00:23:18.860 --> 00:23:22.590
I can't leave it like this! Video! I have to get a video of this!

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:24.090
The battery is out on that.

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.880
Why at such a crucial time?!

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.630
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:30.160
The Greatest Kiss.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.700
You're definitely gonna be happy, Kotoko-chan!
